### Phase 1.3: Advanced Image-to-Chart Conversion

**Files to create/modify:**
- `src/utils/kMeans.ts` — K-Means++ clustering for color quantization
- `src/utils/dithering.ts` — Floyd-Steinberg + Sierra dithering
- `src/utils/imageConverter.ts` — Rewrite to use K-Means + dithering
- `src/components/ImageConversionPanel.tsx` — UI for new options

**Implementation:**

```typescript
// kMeans.ts
export interface ColorCluster {
  center: [number, number, number]; // RGB
  members: { x: number; y: number; color: [r,g,b] }[];
}

export function kMeansCluster(
