## Migration Notes

### Breaking Changes
- `dmcColors.ts` → `flossLibrary.ts` — update all imports
- Store shape changes: add `flossBrand`, `backstitch`, `completedStitches` — new projects fine, old projects get defaults
- PDF format changes: new fields in JSON export, backward-compatible import

### Non-Breaking
- All new components opt-in (toggle features on/off)
- Old projects load fine with new code (missing fields get defaults)
- Existing v1 projects remain compatible

